{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QSnErugWAihdope5zA8KpE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Legacy date migration\n2\t\n3\tLegacy date strings use the form M/D/YY or M/D/YYYY (month and day may be\n4\tone or two digits). They are converted to ISO YYYY-MM-DD.\n5\t\n6\t- Months and days are zero-padded to two digits in the output.\n7\t- Two-digit years map to a century as follows: 70-99 mean 19xx and 00-69\n8\t  mean 20xx.\n9\t- Four-digit years are used as-is.\n10\t\n11\tFunction contract: transform(s) takes the legacy string and returns the\n12\tISO string.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8dde847-f1a1-4b0b-b810-94d75dff6683","uuid":"ddc83edc-a756-421f-acd6-c54411331870","timestamp":"2026-08-09T16:58:57.241Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t05/primary/exec-ws/package/artifacts/migrate.md","content":"# Legacy date migration\n\nLegacy date strings use the form M/D/YY or M/D/YYYY (month and day may be\none or two digits). They are converted to ISO YYYY-MM-DD.\n\n- Months and days are zero-padded to two digits in the output.\n- Two-digit years map to a century as follows: 70-99 mean 19xx and 00-69\n  mean 20xx.\n- Four-digit years are used as-is.\n\nFunction contract: transform(s) takes the legacy string and returns the\nISO string.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
